# pchq_levels.pal - pal harness for the pc-hq (piececraft-hq) levels: registry drift, active-map source, default-world pieces, deterministic generation, map-load argv (see cases/pchq_levels.pdl). Read results/pchq_levels.txt.verdict.txt. Expected VERDICT|FAIL today: the strict registry_* cases report real drift (maps.pdl).
exec ./ops/+x/harness_case_op.+x cases/pchq_levels.pdl
exec ./ops/+x/harness_verdict_op.+x cases/pchq_levels.pdl
halt
